  "description": "Capture calligraphic grace, expressive sumi-e ink textures, and serene spring elegance with Mosel! Designed as a Japanese brush script font, it features bold ink-streaked strokes crowned with delicate cherry blossom flower motifs atop each character stem. Its authentic hand-brushed feel gives titles and logos a poetic, organic, and culturally rich aesthetic. \nIdeal for cherry blossom festival branding, Asian restaurant logos, tea packaging, zen quote prints, floral stationery, spring event invites, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG creations!",
